# Windows mintty / Git Bash storm (permanent)

## Cause
Cursor plugins **Mem0**, **CrowdStrike Falcon Foundry**, and **Forge** register hooks that run `bash` scripts on almost every agent action (Read file, prompt, tool). On Windows each run opens a visible **mintty** window → 200–300 windows, "no available terminals (-1)".

## Owner one-time fix (laptop)
1. Close Cursor fully.
2. Run: `dev_local\kill_mintty_storm.ps1`
3. Run: `dev_local\disable_cursor_bash_hooks.ps1`
4. Reopen Cursor.

Restore hooks only if needed: `dev_local\restore_cursor_bash_hooks.ps1`

## Agent rules (mandatory on this repo)
- Use **PowerShell only** in Shell tool — never `bash`, `sh`, `git bash`, or `&&` chains.
- Do **not** install or re-enable Mem0 / CrowdStrike Foundry / Forge hooks for UniWeb work.
- Prefer `;` in PowerShell instead of `&&`.
- If mintty storm returns after a Cursor update, remind Owner to re-run `disable_cursor_bash_hooks.ps1`.
